       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALLMAIN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 COUNTER PIC 9(3) VALUE 5.
       01 REC.
          05 R-NAME PIC X(6) VALUE "ALPHA".
          05 R-AMT  PIC S9(5)V99 COMP-3 VALUE -12.5.
       01 KEEP PIC 9(3) VALUE 7.
       01 TARGET PIC X(8) VALUE "CALLSUB".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL "CALLSUB" USING COUNTER REC.
           DISPLAY "1 " COUNTER " " R-NAME " " R-AMT.
           CALL "CALLSUB" USING BY CONTENT COUNTER BY REFERENCE REC.
           DISPLAY "2 " COUNTER " " R-NAME " " R-AMT.
           CANCEL "CALLSUB".
           CALL TARGET USING KEEP REC
               ON EXCEPTION MOVE 999 TO KEEP
               NOT ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY "3 " KEEP " " R-AMT
           END-CALL.
           MOVE "NOSUCHPG" TO TARGET.
           CALL TARGET
               ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY "DYN MISSING"
           END-CALL.
           CALL "NOSUCHPG" USING KEEP
               ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY "MISSING"
           END-CALL.
           CALL "CALLSUB2"
           DISPLAY "END".
           STOP RUN.
